# CQ11 [Substructure & mooring] What are the mechanical properties of anchors (anchor load, transport load, fatigue)?
PREFIX optimar: <https://w3id.org/optimar#>
PREFIX sosa: <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/>
PREFIX qudt: <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
PREFIX owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
SELECT ?anchor ?anchorLoad ?transportLoad ?unit ?fatigue WHERE {
  ?anchor a/rdfs:subClassOf* optimar:Anchor .
  OPTIONAL { ?anchor optimar:anchorLoad [ qudt:numericValue ?anchorLoad ; qudt:unit ?unit ] }
  OPTIONAL { ?anchor optimar:transportLoad/qudt:numericValue ?transportLoad }
  OPTIONAL { ?anchor optimar:affectedBy|^optimar:affects ?fatigue . ?fatigue a optimar:MaterialFatigue }
} ORDER BY ?anchor
